# Linguist language statistics
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TextMesh Pro is a third-party package bundled with Unity. Its shader files
# (.shader / .hlsl / .cginc) outweigh the project's own C# by byte count and
# make GitHub mislabel the primary language as ShaderLab. Mark them as vendored
# so language stats reflect the actual C# codebase.
# (Pattern uses '*' to match the space in "TextMesh Pro"; literal spaces in a
#  pattern are not supported by gitattributes.)
Woodoku_Unity/Assets/TextMesh*Pro/** linguist-vendored
